WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.791 --> 00:00:31.708
<b>Here,</b>

2
00:00:31.708 --> 00:00:33.333
<b>Lord Krishna tells Arjuna that</b>

3
00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:40.666
<b>while the Vedas indeed contain knowledge about</b>
<b>the three material qualities of human nature, </b>

4
00:00:40.666 --> 00:00:46.333
<b>you must rise above these </b>
<b>qualities and their worldly knowledge.</b>

5
00:00:46.333 --> 00:00:50.500
<b>By doing so, you will overcome all conflicts,</b>

6
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:55.416
<b>transcend attachments,</b>
<b>focus your mind on eternal truth,</b>

7
00:00:55.416 --> 00:01:01.333
<b>and gain complete mastery over yourself.</b>

8
00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:11.708
<b>Lord Krishna is gradually elevating Arjuna's </b>
<b>level of understanding, one step at a time.</b>

9
00:01:11.708 --> 00:01:14.541
<b>Earlier, Krishna had told Arjuna</b>

10
00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:18.916
<b>that participating in this war</b>
<b>according to his duty</b>

11
00:01:18.916 --> 00:01:22.833
<b>would bring rewards in this life and the next.</b>

12
00:01:22.833 --> 00:01:27.875
<b>Now, Krishna raises the </b>
<b>level of his teachings, saying,</b>

13
00:01:27.875 --> 00:01:28.750
<b>"Arjuna,</b>

14
00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:30.208
<b>what would be truly right</b>

15
00:01:30.208 --> 00:01:34.083
<b>is for you to rise above even</b>
<b>the attachment to these rewards."</b>

16
00:01:34.083 --> 00:01:37.000
<b>This is the mark of a true teacher.</b>

17
00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:38.625
<b>Krishna understands</b>

18
00:01:38.625 --> 00:01:41.291
<b>that in Arjuna's conflicted state,</b>

19
00:01:41.291 --> 00:01:47.500
<b>his spiritual knowledge must be </b>
<b>elevated gradually, not all at once.</b>

20
00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:53.750
<b>When Arjuna had cited his reasons for </b>
<b>not fighting, he had mentioned the Vedas.</b>

21
00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:56.791
<b>Here, Krishna clarifies,</b>

22
00:01:56.791 --> 00:01:57.708
<b>"Yes,</b>

23
00:01:57.708 --> 00:02:01.333
<b>what you spoke of is indeed in the Vedas.</b>

24
00:02:01.333 --> 00:02:06.791
<b>The Vedas contain knowledge of </b>
<b>the three qualities related to material nature.</b>

25
00:02:06.791 --> 00:02:07.541
<b>However,</b>

26
00:02:07.541 --> 00:02:13.833
<b>the Vedas contain far more than just this </b>
<b>they hold superior spiritual wisdom,</b>

27
00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:14.916
<b>and that’s why,</b>

28
00:02:14.916 --> 00:02:19.583
<b> Arjuna must understand this spiritual essence."</b>

29
00:02:19.583 --> 00:02:23.541
<b>The three qualities of material </b>
<b>nature being discussed here</b>

30
00:02:23.541 --> 00:02:25.583
<b>are Sattva,</b>

31
00:02:25.583 --> 00:02:26.416
<b>Rajas,</b>

32
00:02:26.416 --> 00:02:27.791
<b>and Tamas.</b>

33
00:02:27.791 --> 00:02:30.166
<b>In simple terms.</b>

34
00:02:30.166 --> 00:02:33.125
<b>Sattva is the tendency toward knowledge.</b>

35
00:02:33.125 --> 00:02:36.500
<b>Rajas is the tendency toward achievement.</b>

36
00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:40.291
<b>Tamas is the tendency toward ignorance</b>

37
00:02:40.291 --> 00:02:42.708
<b>Krishna is calling upon Arjuna to:</b>

38
00:02:42.708 --> 00:02:47.708
<b>Rise above these three qualities and </b>
<b>embrace the spiritual knowledge of the Vedas.</b>

39
00:02:47.708 --> 00:02:55.791
<b>Know his spiritual nature and perform his duty </b>
<b>without thinking of good or bad outcomes</b>

40
00:02:55.791 --> 00:03:00.541
<b>When one acts without concern for results,</b>

41
00:03:00.541 --> 00:03:05.791
<b>they are no longer troubled by worries </b>
<b>about their protection or sustenance.</b>

42
00:03:05.791 --> 00:03:11.958
<b>This happens because when someone </b>
<b>acts without desiring results,</b>

43
00:03:11.958 --> 00:03:13.791
<b>they become purified.</b>

44
00:03:13.791 --> 00:03:20.000
<b>Through this purification, they gain knowledge </b>
<b>of God, this world, and their true nature.</b>

45
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:20.791
<b>Thereafter,</b>

46
00:03:20.791 --> 00:03:25.541
<b>every action and thought springs </b>
<b>from a single understanding</b>

47
00:03:25.541 --> 00:03:29.916
<b>that they are, in essence, the eternal soul.</b>

48
00:03:29.916 --> 00:03:31.708
<b>And if they are the soul,</b>

49
00:03:31.708 --> 00:03:35.583
<b>where is the question of </b>
<b>worrying about protection?</b>

50
00:03:35.583 --> 00:03:36.500
<b>After all,</b>

51
00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:42.041
<b>protection and sustenance </b>
<b>are needs of the body,</b>

52
00:03:42.041 --> 00:03:43.708
<b>not of the soul!</b>

53
00:03:48.708 --> 00:03:50.500
<b>To become wealthy, </b>

54
00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:52.166
<b>powerful,</b>

55
00:03:52.166 --> 00:03:54.333
<b>and beautiful</b>

56
00:03:54.333 --> 00:04:00.791
<b>These are the attachments that</b>
<b>humans hold dear in this world.</b>

57
00:04:00.791 --> 00:04:04.000
<b>None of these is inherently wrong.</b>

58
00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:09.083
<b>All three have their importance </b>
<b>in the material world,</b>

59
00:04:09.083 --> 00:04:10.291
<b>but</b>

60
00:04:10.291 --> 00:04:13.708
<b>superior to being wealthy, </b>
<b>powerful, and beautiful</b>

61
00:04:13.708 --> 00:04:24.666
<b>is becoming spiritually awakened becoming </b>
<b>someone who knows their spiritual truth. </b>

62
00:04:24.666 --> 00:04:27.291
<b>If you embark on a long journey</b>

63
00:04:27.291 --> 00:04:29.416
<b>without knowing your destination,</b>

64
00:04:29.416 --> 00:04:38.791
<b>without a map, you may enjoy new </b>
<b>sights and paths for a while,</b>

65
00:04:38.791 --> 00:04:39.666
<b>but</b>

66
00:04:39.666 --> 00:04:44.708
<b>soon this joy will turn to anxiety</b>

67
00:04:44.708 --> 00:04:45.625
<b>because</b>

68
00:04:45.625 --> 00:04:49.708
<b>you have lost your way on these new paths.</b>

69
00:04:49.708 --> 00:04:52.708
<b>Where you came from, where you're going</b>

70
00:04:52.708 --> 00:04:55.500
<b>everything becomes confused.</b>

71
00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:56.916
<b>Similarly,</b>

72
00:04:56.916 --> 00:05:03.166
<b>if we begin this worldly journey without</b>
<b>knowing life's true purpose,</b>

73
00:05:03.166 --> 00:05:06.916
<b>without knowing our own existence,</b>

74
00:05:06.916 --> 00:05:12.000
<b>we're likely to stray onto unethical paths.</b>

75
00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:16.541
<b>These unethical paths might seem alluring,</b>

76
00:05:16.541 --> 00:05:22.250
<b>but their long-term consequences </b>
<b>are deeply painful.</b>

77
00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:23.833
<b>First,</b>

78
00:05:23.833 --> 00:05:25.750
<b>become spiritually aware.</b>

79
00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:30.500
<b>Once this purpose of the worldly</b>
<b> journey becomes clear,</b>

80
00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:37.416
<b>you can then enjoy all other paths of life </b>
<b>without losing your way.</b>

81
00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:49.500
<b>It is human nature to be attached to pleasure.</b>

82
00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:50.916
<b>But</b>

83
00:05:50.916 --> 00:05:56.041
<b>if this attachment remains purely material,</b>

84
00:05:56.041 --> 00:06:01.208
<b>two feelings will always torment us.</b>

85
00:06:01.208 --> 00:06:02.583
<b>First is</b>

86
00:06:02.583 --> 00:06:04.791
<b>the expectation of pleasure,</b>

87
00:06:04.791 --> 00:06:06.333
<b>and second is</b>

88
00:06:06.333 --> 00:06:10.791
<b>the fear of losing it.</b>

89
00:06:10.791 --> 00:06:15.500
<b>The seed of unrest lies in these two feelings.</b>

90
00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:17.833
<b>For example</b>

91
00:06:17.833 --> 00:06:23.208
<b>someone's attachment might be </b>
<b>to amass great wealth.</b>

92
00:06:23.208 --> 00:06:30.875
<b>Until the wealth is gathered, </b>
<b>they remain restless with expectation.</b>

93
00:06:30.875 --> 00:06:34.375
<b>And once the wealth is accumulated,</b>

94
00:06:34.375 --> 00:06:37.291
<b>there's the worry of protecting it</b>

95
00:06:37.291 --> 00:06:40.666
<b>and the fear of losing it.</b>

96
00:06:40.666 --> 00:06:45.791
<b>Caught in this cycle of expectation</b>
<b>and fear, humans become trapped,</b>

97
00:06:45.791 --> 00:06:51.666
<b>unable to recognize their spiritual nature.</b>

98
00:06:51.666 --> 00:07:00.375
<b>Peace comes only when one understands </b>
<b>the difference between body and soul,</b>

99
00:07:00.375 --> 00:07:09.166
<b>when one realizes that the body is </b>
<b>merely a vehicle for their eternal journey.</b>

100
00:07:09.166 --> 00:07:20.000
<b>Only after this realization can one be free from the</b>
<b>expectation of pleasureand the fear of its loss. </b>

101
00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:23.708
<b>I have told you this many times before,</b>

102
00:07:23.708 --> 00:07:26.875
<b>and I will continue to say it,</b>

103
00:07:26.875 --> 00:07:31.875
<b>so this truth becomes deeply rooted within you.</b>

104
00:07:31.875 --> 00:07:36.166
<b>Your existence is infinite, eternal.</b>

105
00:07:36.166 --> 00:07:43.500
<b>There is no place for anxiety and fear within it.</b>

106
00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:44.666
<b>Therefore,</b>

107
00:07:44.666 --> 00:07:50.583
<b>use your lifetime for these two purposes:</b>

108
00:07:50.583 --> 00:07:51.666
<b>First,</b>

109
00:07:51.666 --> 00:07:54.208
<b>continue performing your duties</b>

110
00:07:54.208 --> 00:07:58.958
<b>without attachment to results or fear of them.</b>

111
00:07:58.958 --> 00:08:01.000
<b>Second,</b>

112
00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:04.666
<b>keep elevating your spiritual level.</b>

113
00:08:04.666 --> 00:08:09.458
<b>Invest your time in this,</b>

114
00:08:09.458 --> 00:08:14.666
<b>and the joyful thing is that right now,</b>

115
00:08:14.666 --> 00:08:18.875
<b>by listening to and understanding </b>
<b>these teachings of the Gita,</b>

116
00:08:18.875 --> 00:08:22.791
<b>you are investing your time in exactly this.</b>

117
00:08:27.791 --> 00:08:33.875
<b>Arjuna's knowledge itself had </b>
<b>become the cause of his doubts.</b>

118
00:08:33.875 --> 00:08:36.583
<b>His knowledge was correct,</b>

119
00:08:36.583 --> 00:08:39.583
<b>but incomplete.</b>

120
00:08:39.583 --> 00:08:47.541
<b>He thought that according to Vedic knowledge, </b>
<b>his fighting in this war was wrong,</b>

121
00:08:47.541 --> 00:08:54.291
<b>but in thinking this, he was overlooking</b>
<b>the true purpose of the Vedas.</b>

122
00:08:54.291 --> 00:09:00.208
<b>Sometimes our knowledge itself prevents </b>
<b>us from taking right action.</b>

123
00:09:00.208 --> 00:09:04.750
<b>Our assumptions hold us back.</b>

124
00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:08.166
<b>Understand it this way...</b>

125
00:09:08.166 --> 00:09:16.125
<b>The supreme purpose of knowledge </b>
<b>is to end ignorance and destroy anxiety.</b>

126
00:09:16.125 --> 00:09:21.000
<b>So if anxiety troubles you,</b>

127
00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:29.125
<b>it's a clear sign that perhaps </b>
<b>your knowledge is incomeplete,</b>

128
00:09:29.125 --> 00:09:34.416
<b>or you haven't understood it correctly.</b>

129
00:09:34.416 --> 00:09:39.791
<b>The presence of anxiety indicates </b>
<b>the absence of complete knowledge.</b>

130
00:09:39.791 --> 00:09:41.375
<b>For this reason,</b>

131
00:09:41.375 --> 00:09:46.916
<b>I am encouraging Arjuna to understand</b>
<b>the complete knowledge of the Vedas.</b>

132
00:09:46.916 --> 00:09:51.708
<b>Only then will his anxiety end.</b>

133
00:09:51.708 --> 00:09:55.625
<b>You too, do not worry about the future.</b>

134
00:09:55.625 --> 00:09:58.583
<b>Simply continue performing your duties</b>

135
00:09:58.583 --> 00:10:02.416
<b>and keep increasing your spiritual knowledge.</b>

136
00:10:02.416 --> 00:10:05.833
<b>By doing so, anxieties will begin to decrease</b>

137
00:10:05.833 --> 00:10:09.416
<b>and eventually cease.</b>

138
00:10:09.416 --> 00:10:11.375
<b>Become spiritually aware.</b>

139
00:10:11.375 --> 00:10:14.916
<b>If you make this your life's purpose,</b>

140
00:10:14.916 --> 00:10:20.583
<b>all anxieties related to worldly attachments</b>
<b>will naturally dissolve.</b>

